<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "My_life_Without_Your_Love.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>The clock passed 20:00.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Right about now, are <STYLE ID="1">Dad</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Mom</STYLE> worried?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Zzz... zzz..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> must have been tired; she fell asleep after dinner.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If we can make it to morning like this, <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> will probably be able to relax too.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> had gone down to the first floor.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Apparently her <STYLE ID="5">sister</STYLE> had just come home, and she hadn't come back for about 10 minutes.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHGVOL "BGM" "700" "1000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "500" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "NORMAL" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Just then, <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> came back.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She looked somehow gloomy.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"What's wrong? Did something happen?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"No, it's nothing... It's just that I don't get along with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> very well."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Did something happen with your </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">sister</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Hmm, we were close sisters until I was in elementary school... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Probably because people make such a fuss over me as a genius girl, it got hard for </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> to be around me, I think..."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> didn't usually let this kind of thing show, but she kept looking sad.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> must love her <STYLE ID="5">sister</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But the more <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> tries to get close to her <STYLE ID="5">sister</STYLE>, the further away she drifts.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the cafe this afternoon too, I'd sensed a strange distance.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島挨拶バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Oh, but please don't worry about it! </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Sis</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> went out again anyway."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
An emptiness seeped through the big grin <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> flashed.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "312" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
―I turned my eyes toward <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I recalled <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>'s confession from this afternoon.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>'s father has already passed away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> must have gone through painful things too, things I can't understand.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4"> must be worn out after everything that's happened."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Seeing </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> like this, what does </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> think of her?<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">... will you come downstairs with me?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Understood. I don't understand all of it, but I'll tell you what I do understand."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We turned off the light and quietly left the room so as not to wake <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1,人物2" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家リビング.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
There was a faint smell of perfume in the living room.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was the same scent as the waitress I'd smelled at the cafe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It must have belonged to <STYLE ID="5">Goto's sister</STYLE>.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\五島バストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"I'll make some tea. Please have a seat on the sofa."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内歩き.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> went into the kitchen next to the living room.<PG>
Apart from the sounds <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> was making, I couldn't hear a thing.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The living room lights were on, but it was a hazy orange indirect light, a little dark.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"Here you go."</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\皿を置く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\スチル\五島家お茶.gal" "WAIT" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
The tea <STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> served came in an expensive-looking <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="ちゃわん">teacup</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The tea had a lovely aroma, too, like nothing I'd ever smelled.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could the Goto family be rich?<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, do you remember? The first time we talked..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE> spoke with a gentle, slightly grown-up smile.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="4">"It was May, right after I'd started middle school. </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you were a second-year in middle school back then."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\lcm\なつみ→五島.lcm" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "000" "CLICK"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\体育館.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\部活.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> was in the volleyball club in middle school.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I'm short, so I never meant to take it seriously, but I joined the same volleyball club because my parents used to play.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And because I just wanted some chance to do a sport.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ部活.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"What's wrong, <STYLE ID="6">Kogori</STYLE>! You can't even do that?!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The coach was hurling abuse at <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"N-not yet!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　One more!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> refused to let the coach's grueling drills beat her, and chased the ball desperately.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But even to be kind, you couldn't call <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE>'s performance good.<PG>
"That's enough, <STYLE ID="6">Kogori</STYLE>. Okay, next!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Please wait...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Until I get it... please let me keep going...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> could barely stand anymore, but she was still trying to hang on.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Maybe the coach gave in to her persistence too; one more ball came, hit easier than before.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"I did it...! I finally did it...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> had finally managed to touch the ball.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The other upperclassmen let out a sigh too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I wondered why <STYLE ID="6">this senpai</STYLE> was trying so hard.<PG>
I had never made any real effort before.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hadn't done anything special for studying, either. I'd always done well on tests.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
So I didn't really understand the concept of effort, and what <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> was doing was something I couldn't comprehend.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I became interested in <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE>, who tried twice as hard as anyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was rare for me to take an interest in another person.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "Talking_Time.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\体育館裏.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
After practice, <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE>, changed into her uniform, was leaning alone against the gym wall.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Um... good work today..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
When I worked up the nerve to speak to her, <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> turned to me, looking surprised.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Um... who... were you... again...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> looked a little troubled.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No wonder. I'd hardly talked to anyone in the club.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Um... I'm Erina Goto... A first-year in the same volleyball club..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Without meeting <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE>'s eyes, I mumbled my answer.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Back then, I was a gloomy person who couldn't even look people in the eye.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Oh, right, you were there. Sorry I didn't remember you."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"No, it's fine..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> answered with a smile, but I, the one who'd spoken first, was the distant one.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Um... I think I heard your grades are amazing. You're really smart, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> seemed to be desperately searching for something to talk about.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"No, it's not a big deal..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The moment I said it, I realized I'd put <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> on the spot after she'd gone to the trouble of finding a topic.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"So, um... did you need something?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"No... um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">Good work at practice today."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Um... didn't you just say that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Two troubled faces, facing each other.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"You saw me looking pretty uncool back there... I'm not athletic at all."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> kept the conversation going with a smile.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Huh...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="4">　That was... uncool?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Well, I mean, I couldn't even do it, and I still pushed the coach into practicing with me..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't really understand, but isn't that what effort is?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I didn't understand what <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE> meant.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"Why... why is effort uncool?!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\なつみ考えるバストアップ.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">How do I put it... It's hard to explain..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">"Isn't making an effort a really cool thing?!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="4">I don't really get it, but </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you were the coolest of anyone!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I see... </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you're kind of unusual..."</STYLE><PG>
That one remark surprised me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Until then, no one but teachers had ever called me by my surname.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And even they called me Goto-'san'...
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I hate my own name.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Until then, everyone had called me 'Erina-chan.'<PG>
I think the name Erina is too cute for me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On top of that, when people put -chan on it, I feel a kind of wall.<PG>
So being called 'Goto' felt incredibly fresh.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I was happy.<PG>
<STYLE ID="4">"U-um... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="4">, you were cool! Keep it up!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\アスファルトダッシュ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
I ran off without hearing <STYLE ID="6">Senpai</STYLE>'s reply or seeing her reaction.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was a strange feeling. Like I wasn't myself.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In front of <STYLE ID="6">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>, I felt like I'd glimpsed a different me.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
